msgctxt ",3ED71E3F48C28ECA06C7C8B9CF751F32"
msgid "Diary"
msgstr "일기"

#. Key:	CDED5A7347C63A326645BFA6B2E84860
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/InteractingProps/8F/BP_PatientDiagnosisChart.Default__BP_PatientDiagnosisChart_C.ItemDescription
#: /Game/Blueprints/InteractingProps/8F/BP_PatientDiagnosisChart.Default__BP_PatientDiagnosisChart_C.ItemDescription
msgctxt ",CDED5A7347C63A326645BFA6B2E84860"
msgid ""
"My head is pounding.\r\n"
"The 9th-floor doctor's lounge... I have absolutely no memory of how or why I passed out here.\r\n"
"The name tag on this bloodstained coat tells me I'm a doctor at this hospital, but everything else is buried in a hazy fog.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"What the hell are those grotesque footsteps and screams echoing from the hallway? It looks like the entire building is on total lockdown. The power is completely cut.\r\n"
"I have to find a way out of here alive. Before whatever is lurking outside that door finds me..."
msgstr ""
"머리가 너무 아파요.\r\n"
"9층 의사 휴게실... 여기서 어떻게 기절했는지 전혀 기억나지 않습니다.\r\n"
"이 피 묻은 코트의 명찰은 내가 이 병원의 의사임을 알려주지만, 나머지는 모두 흐릿한 안개 속에 묻혀 있다.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"복도에서 울려 퍼지는 저 끔찍한 발걸음과 비명 소리는 도대체 뭐지? 건물 전체가 완전 봉쇄된 것 같아. 전기가 완전히 끊겼어.\r\n"
"여기서 살아서 나갈 방법을 찾아야 해. 저 문 밖에 숨어 있는 무언가가 나를 찾기 전에..."

#. Key:	616B4B2245D9AC86322071BDF55EDDC2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/InteractingProps/8F/BP_PatientDiagnosisChart.Default__BP_PatientDiagnosisChart_C.ItemName
#: /Game/Blueprints/InteractingProps/8F/BP_PatientDiagnosisChart.Default__BP_PatientDiagnosisChart_C.ItemName
msgctxt ",616B4B2245D9AC86322071BDF55EDDC2"
msgid "Diary"
msgstr "일기"

#. Key:	B054B2734A1385AC13DF77ABEAA6F4D0
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/InteractingProps/8F/BP_PatientsLetter.Default__BP_PatientsLetter_C.ItemDescription
#: /Game/Blueprints/InteractingProps/8F/BP_PatientsLetter.Default__BP_PatientsLetter_C.ItemDescription
msgctxt ",B054B2734A1385AC13DF77ABEAA6F4D0"
msgid "Doctor, you said you'd cure me. You promised to take away the pain. So I gave you my heart, my mind, my everything. But you left me alone in the dark. Don't worry, my love. I will find you. Even if I have to tear this hospital apart, piece by bloody piece. We will be together forever."
msgstr "의사 선생님, 저를 치료해 주신다고 하셨잖아요. 고통을 없애주겠다고 약속했잖아. 그래서 나는 내 마음과 정신, 내 모든 것을 너에게 줬어. 하지만 넌 나를 어둠 속에 혼자 남겨뒀어. 걱정 마, 내 사랑. 내가 널 찾을 거야. 이 병원을 피투성이로 한 조각씩 부숴야 한다 해도. 우리는 영원히 함께할 거야."

#. Key:	8D37795D47E7460B221C04B27D50DBA3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/InteractingProps/8F/BP_PatientsLetter.Default__BP_PatientsLetter_C.ItemName
#: /Game/Blueprints/InteractingProps/8F/BP_PatientsLetter.Default__BP_PatientsLetter_C.ItemName
msgctxt ",8D37795D47E7460B221C04B27D50DBA3"
msgid "Diary"
msgstr "일기"

#. Key:	5377574B4AD7B5D70B2018A472C88B97
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/InteractingProps/9F/BP_Diary.Default__BP_Diary_C.ItemDescription
#: /Game/Blueprints/InteractingProps/9F/BP_Diary.Default__BP_Diary_C.ItemDescription
msgctxt ",5377574B4AD7B5D70B2018A472C88B97"
msgid "Patient 804. Symptoms escalated rapidly overnight. Initial diagnosis of severe paranoia has been updated. The patient claims the shadows are whispering and exhibits extreme photosensitivity. Sedatives are completely ineffective. We need to move them to the lower floors immediately... God, what is happening to this hospital?"
msgstr "환자 804. 증상은 하룻밤 사이에 급격히 악화되었습니다. 심한 편집증 초기 진단이 업데이트되었습니다. 환자는 그림자가 속삭이고 극심한 광민성을 보인다고 주장합니다. 진정제는 전혀 효과가 없습니다. 즉시 아래층으로 옮겨야 해... 세상에, 이 병원에 무슨 일이 일어나고 있는 거죠?"

#. Key:	66145B284184D7E1AD8D45BBB51D3419
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/InteractingProps/9F/BP_Diary.Default__BP_Diary_C.ItemName
#: /Game/Blueprints/InteractingProps/9F/BP_Diary.Default__BP_Diary_C.ItemName
msgctxt ",66145B284184D7E1AD8D45BBB51D3419"
msgid "Diary"
msgstr "일기"

#. Key:	314A4D294118E41DFB0180BA5701589B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/InteractingProps/9F/BP_Phone.Default__BP_Phone_C.ItemDescription
#: /Game/Blueprints/InteractingProps/9F/BP_Phone.Default__BP_Phone_C.ItemDescription
msgctxt ",314A4D294118E41DFB0180BA5701589B"
msgid "\"You did this... I know you knew what was in those syringes. Nurse Sarah is dead because of you. The lockdown is active, but they are crawling up the stairs. Don't you dare come out of that room. We will find you before they do.\""
msgstr "\"네가 이랬어... 네가 그 주사기 안에 뭐가 들어 있는지 알고 있었던 거 알아. 간호사 사라가 죽은 건 네 탓이야. 봉쇄는 진행 중이지만, 아이들은 계단을 기어오르고 있다. 그 방에서 절대 나오지 마. 우리가 그들보다 먼저 널 찾을 거야.\""

